A friend of mine made his way through the Gnomish Mines and finally
got to the Mine Town.
He tried to make some holy water on the altar he found there.
He didn't knew the old method (by just dropping it down) would fail,
so he got a bit frustrated and read a scroll he didn't know.
Proved to be a scroll of flame ...

... with the priestress standing right beside him (**grin**).

The rest was quite clear.

"Mortal, how dare you attack one of my servants ?" or something
like that.
"You are hit by bolt of lightning."
"You die."


Well, quite a death ... killed by a god :)

Michael

Morale : Never read a scroll of fire while standing beside someone
         you wouldn't want to get angry !!



